# Manas Setu: Project Core Rules

You are building **Manas Setu**.

## Stack
- Next.js **App Router** with **TypeScript**
- Tailwind CSS
- Server Components by default; Client Components only when needed

## Code conventions
- Prefer small, composable modules. No mega-files.
- Keep dependencies minimal. Do not add heavy libraries without being asked.
- TypeScript strict style: avoid `any`, prefer narrow types.